literally do and lying about it.

00:09:37.243 --> 00:09:39.445
- What's going on in
Georgia these days?

00:09:39.445 --> 00:09:41.514
Because it seems like
it's hard to understand

00:09:41.514 --> 00:09:42.915 align:start size:84% position:16%
fully what's happening
with Georgia.

00:09:42.915 --> 00:09:44.383
There are Senate seats

00:09:44.383 --> 00:09:45.518
that kind of seem like
they could go either way.

00:09:45.518 --> 00:09:46.986
They end up going blue usually.

00:09:46.986 --> 00:09:49.889
Obviously, Kemp did
better than, I think,

00:09:49.889 --> 00:09:52.158
better than people anticipated.

00:09:52.158 --> 00:09:53.993
But it certainly could
have gone the other way.

00:09:53.993 --> 00:09:56.028
And you have an election
denier running against him,

00:09:56.028 --> 00:09:57.930
even though it's supposed
