the list goes on with that.

00:10:47.713 --> 00:10:50.483 align:start size:88% position:13%
But so people in Georgia
had a lot of things

00:10:50.483 --> 00:10:52.451 align:start size:84% position:16%
to be happy with
Governor Kemp about.

00:10:52.451 --> 00:10:56.255
Another thing that he did is
