00:13:04.083 --> 00:13:05.785
You were banned on Twitter.

00:13:05.785 --> 00:13:08.788 align:start size:97% position:3%
Was that your personal account
or your government account?

00:13:08.788 --> 00:13:09.955
- Just yesterday, it was
my government account.

00:13:09.955 --> 00:13:11.891 align:start size:84% position:16%
- Oh, you were banned
yesterday again?

00:13:11.891 --> 00:13:13.159 align:start size:84% position:16%
- Well, okay.
- I was talking about,

00:13:13.159 --> 00:13:14.393
I didn't even know that.

00:13:14.393 --> 00:13:15.528
I was talking about
the original one.

00:13:15.528 --> 00:13:17.263
- Okay, so the original one

00:13:17.263 --> 00:13:19.799
was my personal and
campaign account,

00:13:19.799 --> 00:13:21.967 align:start size:84% position:16%
banned for the
entire year of 2022.

00:13:21.967 --> 00:13:24.069
It was during my reelection.

00:13:24.069 --> 00:13:25.304
I couldn't raise money,

00:13:25.304 --> 00:13:27.473
I couldn't message. I
couldn't put my ads.

00:13:27.473 --> 00:13:29.775
I couldn't fight back
