were writing articles about.

00:13:50.029 --> 00:13:52.665 align:start size:84% position:16%
It was about the
Trans Day of Vengeance

00:13:52.665 --> 00:13:54.834 align:start size:84% position:16%
that was being
planned, is planned.

00:13:54.834 --> 00:13:56.068
- Oh, I did see the tweet.

00:13:56.068 --> 00:13:56.902
I didn't realize you
were banned for it too.

00:13:56.902 --> 00:13:58.437
I know that Sean Davis.

00:13:58.437 --> 00:14:01.340
- Whole bunch of people
got banned or got striked

00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:03.175
