got banned for seven days.

00:14:36.041 --> 00:14:39.478
But they've reopened my
account this morning.

00:14:39.478 --> 00:14:41.981
- Oh, so did they force
you to delete the tweet?

00:14:41.981 --> 00:14:43.249
- Of course, yeah.

00:14:43.249 --> 00:14:44.416
- So they forced you
to delete the tweet,

00:14:44.416 --> 00:14:45.584 align:start size:84% position:16%
but they did at least
let you back up.

00:14:45.584 --> 00:14:46.952 align:start size:84% position:16%
- Yeah, but they
were whitewashing it.

00:14:46.952 --> 00:14:48.420
Look at this,

00:14:48.420 --> 00:14:51.390 align:start size:97% position:3%
they were trying to completely
take this off of Twitter,

00:14:51.390 --> 00:14:52.892
which is wrong.

00:14:52.892 --> 00:14:56.161 align:start size:88% position:13%
And it was, this wasn't
any of us attack.

00:14:56.161 --> 00:14:58.797
It was not an attack
