00:15:08.007 --> 00:15:10.809
and seems connected to
the Nashville shooting

00:15:10.809 --> 00:15:12.945 align:start size:81% position:19%
right there in
the Supreme Court.

00:15:12.945 --> 00:15:15.681
- I'm pretty sure if they had
the MAGA Day of Vengeance,

00:15:15.681 --> 00:15:19.351 align:start size:88% position:13%
people would not be that
thrilled about that.

00:15:19.351 --> 00:15:20.786
- The DC jail would be full.

00:15:20.786 --> 00:15:22.721
