00:15:28.294 --> 00:15:30.930 align:start size:84% position:16%
actually took your
account out last year?

00:15:30.930 --> 00:15:33.198
- I do have some
knowledge of that.

00:15:33.198 --> 00:15:35.868 align:start size:97% position:3%
John Solomon has done some
really good reporting on that.

00:15:35.868 --> 00:15:37.803 align:start size:81% position:19%
And then we had
the Twitter execs,

00:15:37.803 --> 00:15:40.506 align:start size:97% position:3%
they came into our
oversight hearings as well.

00:15:40.506 --> 00:15:43.509
I didn't let them talk during
my five, we get five minutes.

00:15:43.509 --> 00:15:45.477
So I told them, I said,
"All right, you guys,

00:15:45.477 --> 00:15:49.148 align:start size:94% position:6%
you silenced me and stole
my freedom of speech

00:15:49.148 --> 00:15:53.686
during the entire year of
2022, during my campaign."

00:15:53.686 --> 00:15:55.487
I said, "By the way, I won.

00:15:55.487 --> 00:15:57.089 align:start size:88% position:13%
So you didn't, you
weren't that effective."

00:15:57.089 --> 00:15:59.758 align:start size:97% position:3%
But I said, "So I'm silencing
you for my five minutes."

00:15:59.758 --> 00:16:02.161
And I proceeded to
let them have it.

00:16:02.161 --> 00:16:04.563
And I called Yoel Roth out

00:16:04.563 --> 00:16:09.568 align:start size:94% position:6%
on his disgusting
affection for child porn.

00:16:10.736 --> 00:16:14.640
And that it was his duty
and his job in Twitter

00:16:14.640 --> 00:16:17.176 align:start size:97% position:3%
to take that off of Twitter,
and he did not do it.

00:16:17.176 --> 00:16:19.178 align:start size:97% position:3%
- It was really weird, the
child porn thing with Twitter,

00:16:19.178 --> 00:16:20.846 align:start size:84% position:16%
because nobody seemed
to care about it

00:16:20.846 --> 00:16:22.848
until Elon Musk came over.

00:16:22.848 --> 00:16:24.149 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then suddenly
everybody cared about it.

00:16:24.149 --> 00:16:25.684 align:start size:84% position:16%
Elon's doing more
about it than anybody,

00:16:25.684 --> 00:16:28.187
