00:29:00.538 --> 00:29:05.376
We definitely need to stay
the United States of America.

00:29:05.376 --> 00:29:08.146
But many Republicans,
many conservatives

00:29:08.146 --> 00:29:12.016
have gotten so fed up
with the left's ideas.

00:29:12.016 --> 00:29:14.352
The climate change lies.

00:29:14.352 --> 00:29:16.855
I'm sorry, we don't wanna
give up our gas stoves.

00:29:16.855 --> 00:29:19.824
We like to be able to buy a gas

00:29:19.824 --> 00:29:23.328 align:start size:94% position:6%
or diesel-fueled
combustion engine vehicle.

00:29:23.328 --> 00:29:25.196 align:start size:84% position:16%
We don't wanna be
forced onto electric.

00:29:25.196 --> 00:29:26.598
I mean, we might
choose to buy it,

00:29:26.598 --> 00:29:27.999
but we don't wanna be forced.

00:29:27.999 --> 00:29:30.502 align:start size:84% position:16%
We don't want our
children being taught

00:29:30.502 --> 00:29:32.137
that there's more
than two genders.

00:29:32.137 --> 00:29:35.707 align:start size:97% position:3%
We say there's only two
