00:29:46.117 --> 00:29:48.052
And so that's what
I was talking about

00:29:48.052 --> 00:29:50.121
when I mentioned national
divorce and dividing up.

00:29:50.121 --> 00:29:52.056 align:start position:0%
- Is that just one of those
things that as you're saying it,

00:29:52.056 --> 00:29:54.692 align:start size:97% position:3%
