what the media's about to do."

00:29:54.692 --> 00:29:57.162 align:start size:88% position:13%
- Yeah, (laughs) always.
They always do it.

00:29:57.162 --> 00:29:58.396
- Yeah.
- So.

00:29:58.396 --> 00:30:00.398 align:start size:81% position:19%
- Do you bother
