CNN, I do talk with
them on the hill.

00:30:11.576 --> 00:30:14.712 align:start size:97% position:3%
There's a lot of pretty
good reporters on the hill.

00:30:14.712 --> 00:30:16.948
I try not to attack the media

00:30:16.948 --> 00:30:20.785
