respect the press,

00:30:20.785 --> 00:30:23.021
and I really want to see them.

00:30:23.021 --> 00:30:26.291
I wanna see the political
bias drop out of the press.

00:30:26.291 --> 00:30:30.929
And I think the profession
of journalism is a dying art.

00:30:30.929 --> 00:30:34.766 align:start size:97% position:3%
And I really wanna see it come
back, and I want the press,

00:30:34.766 --> 00:30:37.535 align:start size:88% position:13%
and I tell them, I
literally tell 'em this.

00:30:37.535 --> 00:30:40.772
I'm probably one of the
few members of Congress,

00:30:40.772 --> 00:30:42.340
if it really came down to it,

00:30:42.340 --> 00:30:45.276
that would fight to the very
