00:30:45.276 --> 00:30:46.978
Because I think it's important,

00:30:46.978 --> 00:30:48.613
and it needs to be preserved.

00:30:48.613 --> 00:30:50.782
And I'm also, at the same time,

00:30:50.782 --> 00:30:54.385 align:start size:88% position:13%
one of the most attacked
