00:30:54.385 --> 00:30:56.788
But I have a faith in humanity,

00:30:56.788 --> 00:31:00.625
and I really wanna see
them do a better job.

00:31:00.625 --> 00:31:04.863 align:start size:97% position:3%
And I would like to see our
