00:31:24.415 --> 00:31:26.718
for more pushing
of banning guns.

00:31:26.718 --> 00:31:29.020
I mean, Biden basically
is saying it already.

00:31:29.020 --> 00:31:32.056 align:start size:94% position:6%
Obviously you're a big
Second Amendment advocate.

00:31:32.056 --> 00:31:34.525 align:start size:94% position:6%
Is there any, I mean,
what can we be done here?

00:31:34.525 --> 00:31:35.994
Is there anything
that can be done

00:31:35.994 --> 00:31:37.528 align:start size:94% position:6%
or is this just, it's
now baked into the system

00:31:37.528 --> 00:31:39.931 align:start size:94% position:6%
that these things are
just gonna keep happening?

00:31:39.931 --> 00:31:41.399
- I have a unique perspective.

00:31:41.399 --> 00:31:43.234 align:start size:94% position:6%
When I was in 11th grade,
it was the first year

00:31:43.234 --> 00:31:46.571
that then Senator Joe Biden
had gotten the law passed

00:31:46.571 --> 00:31:49.173 align:start size:84% position:16%
to make schools
gun-free school zones.

00:31:49.173 --> 00:31:50.775
And before that, you know,

00:31:50.775 --> 00:31:52.310
the guys would pull
up in their trucks,

00:31:52.310 --> 00:31:54.979 align:start size:94% position:6%
and they had their hunting
rifles in their trucks.

00:31:54.979 --> 00:31:57.949
It wasn't uncommon for
guns to be at school.

00:31:57.949 --> 00:32:00.852
But when I was in 11th
grade, that law passed.

00:32:00.852 --> 00:32:02.453 align:start size:84% position:16%
Schools became
gun-free school zones.

00:32:02.453 --> 00:32:05.390
One of the kids at my school
brought three guns to school

00:32:05.390 --> 00:32:07.058
into the first period class

00:32:07.058 --> 00:32:11.329 align:start size:97% position:3%
and took over our entire
school after firing a weapon.

00:32:11.329 --> 00:32:14.098
And so we spent five
hours on lockdown.

00:32:14.098 --> 00:32:17.335
So I know that fear of
being trapped in a school

00:32:17.335 --> 00:32:19.203 align:start size:84% position:16%
where there's no
good guy with a gun.

00:32:19.203 --> 00:32:22.173
The only person that has
a gun, and he had three,

00:32:22.173 --> 00:32:27.178 align:start size:97% position:3%
was a very mentally disturbed,
emotionally upset student

00:32:28.046 --> 00:32:29.781
that was around my same age.

00:32:29.781 --> 00:32:33.184
And we were all at mercy of
what he might decide to do.

00:32:33.184 --> 00:32:35.620
Luckily no one died that day.

00:32:35.620 --> 00:32:40.158
So I have that perspective,
and I believe children are,

00:32:40.158 --> 00:32:42.226
they're our most
precious resource.

00:32:42.226 --> 00:32:44.429
If President Biden
is protected by guns,

00:32:44.429 --> 00:32:46.531 align:start size:81% position:19%
Nancy Pelosi is
protected by guns,

00:32:46.531 --> 00:32:49.100 align:start size:88% position:13%
our capital is protected
by men with guns,

00:32:49.100 --> 00:32:50.835 align:start size:84% position:16%
I think our kids
should be protected.

00:32:50.835 --> 00:32:54.172 align:start size:94% position:6%
And if this threat, we see
it over and over again,

00:32:54.172 --> 00:32:56.407 align:start size:97% position:3%
if it's going to keep
going, well, you know what?

00:32:56.407 --> 00:32:59.444 align:start size:97% position:3%
We need to harden our
schools and protect our kids

00:32:59.444 --> 00:33:01.612
the same way we protect gold,

00:33:01.612 --> 00:33:04.582 align:start size:84% position:16%
