Hollywood celebrities,

00:33:04.582 --> 00:33:06.617
their big banquets
and award ceremonies.

00:33:06.617 --> 00:33:08.753
I believe that's
what we should do.

00:33:08.753 --> 00:33:10.755
But I've asked this question,

00:33:10.755 --> 00:33:15.059 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think we need to finally
take a look at SSRIs.

00:33:15.059 --> 00:33:16.694
We need to look at
these medications

00:33:16.694 --> 00:33:18.629 align:start size:97% position:3%
for anxiety and
depression, 'cause, I mean,

00:33:18.629 --> 00:33:20.498 align:start size:88% position:13%
pretty much every single
one of these shooters

00:33:20.498 --> 00:33:22.533
